  "title": "Choco-Coconut Bar Cookies",
  "description": "These coconut bar cookies are crowd-friendly, with an easy-to-make brown sugar and melted chocolate crust, and a simple, chewy, toasty coconut filling!",
  "authors": [
    "debbthebee"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:17:14-05:00",
